OL,3,GNEWSAMan given 21-month jail term in
OL,4,A2006 finally freed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been freed from prison after
OL,7,Fspending 20 years behind bars after a
OL,8,Fcourt ruled his original sentence was
OL,9,Fimposed in error.
OL,11,FLuke Ings was 17 when he was sentenced
OL,12,Fin 2006 after admitting offences
OL,13,Fincluding a robbery in a Bracknell
OL,14,Funderpass and an assault on a teenager
OL,15,Fin a fast-food restaurant.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
