OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan given 21-month jail term in
OL,4,A2006 finally freed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough the 38-year-old was given a
OL,7,Fminimum tariff of 21 months, he was
OL,8,Fhanded a detention for public
OL,9,Fprotection (DPP) sentence, a type of
OL,10,Findefinite sentence introduced for
OL,11,Foffenders considered a risk to the
OL,12,Fpublic.
OL,14,FOn Wednesday, a judge quashed his
OL,15,Foriginal sentence, replaced it with a
OL,16,Fsentence of 42 months, and released him
OL,17,Ffrom custody.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
